---
import { Headline } from "./Headline";
---

<div
    class="flex flex-col justify-center items-end min-h-screen py-20 text-right"
>
    <Headline level={2}>About Us</Headline>
    <p
        class="mt-2 text-xl font-light leading-snug text-secondary md:text-2xl md:w-1/2"
    >
        The <strong class="text-primary"
            >Berlin Learning & Intelligent Systems Society</strong
        > (BLISS) started in 2022 as a student initiative and became a registered
        non-profit that same year. Volunteers run it for students and young
        professionals who want to read, question and discuss AI research, not just
        hear about it.
        <br />
        During the semester, researchers from places like Google DeepMind, Oxford
        and the Max Planck Institute give a <a href="/speaker-series" class="text-primary"
            >talk at TU Berlin</a
        > every two weeks. On Mondays, our <a href="/reading-group" class="text-primary"
            >reading group</a
        > works through recent machine learning papers. We add <a href="/workshops" class="text-primary"
            >workshops</a
        >, hackathons and social events, and we stay independent of companies and
        universities.
    </p>
    <div lang="de" class="mt-10 md:w-1/2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-red-right font-bold pb-2">
            KI-Verein in Berlin
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xl font-light leading-snug text-secondary md:text-2xl">
            BLISS ist ein eingetragener Verein für Studierende und Berufseinsteiger, die sich
            für künstliche Intelligenz interessieren. Unsere KI-Events in Berlin reichen von
            Vorträgen an der TU Berlin bis zur wöchentlichen Reading Group, und zu den
            Vorträgen ist der Eintritt frei.
            <a href="/ki-verein-berlin" class="text-primary">Mehr über den KI-Verein</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
